    "comment": "Thresholds are chosen on June (calibration) as the most sensitive grid point inside the alarm budget, then frozen for July (decision 2026-10-06). The test period (Aug-Dec) is never read. Model choices (june_level, peer_adjustment, relative_scale_floor, minimum_effect_share) were compared on July development data as Q-19 allows; see docs/project-status/detector-run-2026-10-14.md.",
